@prefix cul: <https://recipes.example/culinary#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://recipes.example/culinary#Ingredient> a owl:Class .
<https://recipes.example/culinary#Ingredient> rdfs:comment "Something a recipe is made of." .
<https://recipes.example/culinary#Recipe> a owl:Class .
<https://recipes.example/culinary#Recipe> rdfs:comment "A dish somebody can actually cook." .
<https://recipes.example/culinary#hasIngredient> a owl:ObjectProperty .
<https://recipes.example/culinary#hasIngredient> rdfs:domain cul:Recipe .
<https://recipes.example/culinary#hasIngredient> rdfs:range cul:Ingredient .
